<h1 local-id=3D"24e140b5-f674-416c-9dca-6866bc059e96" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-AxonTransactionProcessing">Axon Transaction Processing</h1=
>
<h2 local-id=3D"772edaa4-7426-4e3f-9d56-fc306ee392d8" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-Overview">Overview</h2>
<p local-id=3D"6a57d4c1-911c-442e-9ea1-7ceed2966b7e">ISO 8583 is an interna=
tional standard for financial transaction card-originated messages. It defi=
nes the message format and communication flow for transactions between devi=
ces and card issuers/acquirers.</p>
<hr local-id=3D"83d26165-1f84-4477-983a-a3b4b123c96f">
<h2 local-id=3D"841fb360-2b35-4608-a342-715a0ef04c7b" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-CommonISOMessageTypes(MTI-MessageTypeIndicator)">Common IS=
O Message Types (MTI - Message Type Indicator)</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"72d092c4-8b6d-474e-aa85-b971862f8838" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-1.0100-AuthorizationRequest">1. <strong>0100 - Authorizati=
on Request</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"8a96fd3b-1588-459b-b099-966e92b31f0a">
<li local-id=3D"6eb9c02a-19b1-4b53-b7aa-6f837705ef89">
<p local-id=3D"f4fdfbff-315d-4a98-bac5-e89add806047"><strong>Purpose</stron=
g>: Request for authorization of a financial transaction</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d01b3950-0029-4e30-8e97-b3b0f9d93d1d">
<p local-id=3D"9d9d7af7-d4f5-4ce9-a9db-0b49ec48555a"><strong>Significance</=
strong>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"e61696c4-028a-4180-9bd2-cfdc3987d21d">
<li local-id=3D"14732ffd-c221-41ea-99a0-a0c7bb9f3b1d">
<p local-id=3D"c41f25f0-a3e2-452d-bb60-15c5dccd63d6">Initial request from m=
erchant/ATM to card issuer</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8b196ed9-29fc-4be3-9ddb-606272e03721">
<p local-id=3D"700eb5e2-120a-4fdc-94b0-9738a1533fcf">Used for purchase, wit=
hdrawal, or payment transactions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ee3d823c-8025-4b9d-9ad7-28866408c7f9">
<p local-id=3D"24654ea2-3d10-406e-a23d-e5db3a5cd4fa">Requires real-time res=
ponse from issuer</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"148958cf-de4f-45eb-b4e3-1807ca6fbd09">
<p local-id=3D"bd411ada-2c05-4920-981c-8ebfa9259ed7">Contains card details,=
 amount, merchant info, and transaction type</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"ad583a5b-d942-4fc7-9a21-e777757f11af" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-2.0110-AuthorizationResponse">2. <strong>0110 - Authorizat=
ion Response</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"8ab85c6f-128b-4521-b3f1-04f3fe8846fd">
<li local-id=3D"e5c66e06-c4e1-42bc-8c7e-77d284735558">
<p local-id=3D"362cc7e2-45e9-4ec4-b393-e18e6fb13641"><strong>Purpose</stron=
g>: Response to authorization request</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2349b7e7-3de1-4bac-bb31-a1d66bed4cf8">
<p local-id=3D"16fbd9ae-8741-4009-a33d-074ccf0d3541"><strong>Significance</=
strong>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"5c6307e4-bd27-4a89-a833-92fb1b2c5062">
<li local-id=3D"b0dd2d25-e8a0-4d3c-a7a7-325ce79ea23d">
<p local-id=3D"d35927b4-4d64-4917-87be-ba892c12f263">Sent by issuer back to=
 acquirer/merchant</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"87a20a68-a40e-4966-8b17-8699574e3513">
<p local-id=3D"8f51f4d6-783b-4e64-a666-07f95f085b1b">Contains approval/decl=
ine decision</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cc953a6d-79e3-434a-9ab6-eb1c94f65d46">
<p local-id=3D"e0679ddf-3cdd-49c7-8e25-589bffd21aae">Includes response code=
 (approved, insufficient funds, invalid card, etc.)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9f4b6f0e-1350-4bd0-a9de-04af4ea32c9b">
<p local-id=3D"efdc2af1-aca8-4835-bacb-f48c0c26838c">May include authorizat=
ion code if approved</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"be38e199-fbf3-4dc3-ba03-8dc41067b526" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-3.0120-AuthorizationAdvice">3. <strong>0120 - Authorizatio=
n Advice</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"52f37e8e-3462-42fb-a9fc-2c5c76996d56">
<li local-id=3D"3269cbcc-0501-47fc-92b2-b252f96ab765">
<p local-id=3D"d9cb7209-4cfc-4db2-b203-e4f2f92400e8"><strong>Purpose</stron=
g>: Notification that a transaction has been completed</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d62e125c-127c-49e2-92a5-e990dcec509e">
<p local-id=3D"7d5b6d55-ffb1-40f2-befb-35d28f479c6f"><strong>Significance</=
strong>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7ba571d9-3128-4f65-8b26-c72998493aa7">
<li local-id=3D"db178d8c-432f-4d5d-9df2-9addb4680470">
<p local-id=3D"2caf50cb-9370-478c-8a17-5d21e9f34060">Used when authorizatio=
n was obtained offline or through alternate means</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ab89440-ff5f-4ae9-b315-31d23b4c6db3">
<p local-id=3D"ff15f4b2-0ded-4eeb-8333-e6bb26cf84af">Informs issuer of comp=
leted transaction</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"09d8ef68-0b74-4562-8963-e8c89ded2d4f">
<p local-id=3D"f654df9f-a15f-400c-b629-d34a1886f0f7">No response expected (=
advice message)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2a1ed405-ccb4-49d4-9371-82a295a63424">
<p local-id=3D"d2d1c905-d636-4688-a582-e8a6bf4a6eaf">Common in chip card tr=
ansactions</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"2318ae13-ff38-40d6-9047-7ecd95ae3a3a" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-4.0200-FinancialTransactionRequest">4. <strong>0200 - Fina=
ncial Transaction Request</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"2e032c51-933f-45ea-b086-1d65437ca7c3">
<li local-id=3D"35080ae0-fa00-4f65-87c0-0d108bdc6e1f">
<p local-id=3D"28d59d1f-3aad-4e90-b3d9-52eac0f16d61"><strong>Purpose</stron=
g>: Request for financial transaction (debit/credit)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"87774b4c-1fdd-4af2-825a-fffc496daaf0">
<p local-id=3D"6cc832f6-d2fc-4200-ace4-27bda8645912"><strong>Significance</=
strong>:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"452237e6-8647-4187-89ff-a129b3c13ef8">
<li local-id=3D"b573ba62-af08-4cd4-944c-ff751072393a">
<p local-id=3D"bc88f1c5-816b-4603-99e8-026c5a80fcf6">Used for actual fund t=
ransfer</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"493a9e8e-9acc-4c79-be21-7864797762a2">
<p local-id=3D"1e42f602-56bf-44c8-83b2-8f2abbe76b99">Can be for purchase, w=
ithdrawal, refund, or payment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1fc995dc-3729-44af-b08b-e089881c0000">
<p local-id=3D"1c9aa512-1aed-46f8-a187-2a9ac9d74a20">Requires settlement</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"64e30cb9-6c9b-45f6-9629-66207df19ae6">
<p local-id=3D"9daef179-ece1-4678-aa0c-7dd6878f1f37">More critical than aut=
horization as it affects accounts</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"a746a084-4731-4e7a-babb-744f9f9c33f5" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-5.0210-FinancialTransactionResponse">5. <strong>0210 - Fin=
ancial Transaction Response</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"acf4cd92-2f8d-4627-ab2e-233992cde8b2">
<li local-id=3D"2e8eb198-708d-4e18-8a0f-b6cead1b4b82">
<p local-id=3D"1e78fc49-c921-48b5-ae8f-bb8a5286d3b6"><strong>Purpose</stron=
g>: Response to financial transaction request</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5ecfe6d3-9fcc-443c-9ce4-d3a37ff4cf4e">
<p local-id=3D"c6e02897-5e06-4760-85f8-a623166793e2"><strong>Significance</=
