<hr local-id=3D"827963a7-4032-4ff8-b94e-2648fd4187da">
<h2 local-id=3D"a8aafd6f-739b-441e-a444-5c9ddb6154e8" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-TransactionFlowExample">Transaction Flow Example</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"ba7d5f19-8518-43e3-9f36-5654431cd007" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-PurchaseTransactionFlow">Purchase Transaction Flow</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">1. Cust=
omer swipes card at POS
2. POS =E2=86=92 Acquirer: 0100 (Auth Request)
3. Acquirer =E2=86=92 Issuer: 0100 (Auth Request)
4. Issuer checks balance/fraud
5. Issuer =E2=86=92 Acquirer: 0110 (Auth Response - Approved)
6. Acquirer =E2=86=92 POS: 0110 (Auth Response - Approved)
7. POS =E2=86=92 Acquirer: 0220 (Financial Advice)
8. Acquirer =E2=86=92 Issuer: 0220 (Financial Advice)
9. Settlement occurs in batch</pre>
</div>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"55c459d9-8f93-4fc7-b248-b5ee6d43fce5" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-ErrorHandlingFlow">Error Handling Flow</h3>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">If erro=
r occurs after authorization:
10. POS =E2=86=92 Acquirer: 0400 (Reversal Request)
11. Acquirer =E2=86=92 Issuer: 0400 (Reversal Request)
12. Issuer =E2=86=92 Acquirer: 0410 (Reversal Response)</pre>
</div>
</div>
