<hr local-id=3D"c3cc9509-7a66-4426-935e-16ddc46d6e5e">
<h2 local-id=3D"0df5e086-29ff-4d2f-bec9-a7ec830a610b" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-TransactionProcessingFlows">Transaction Processing Flows</=
h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"14766060-8490-411f-ab50-735792e70a5a" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-Two-StepFlow:0100=E2=86=920110=E2=86=920120=E2=86=920220">=
Two-Step Flow: 0100 =E2=86=92 0110 =E2=86=92 0120 =E2=86=92 0220</h3>
<p local-id=3D"a29f8f03-de9d-4a3a-8561-b833dc82f9d1"><strong>Characteristic=
s:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"15b88807-ba1e-45cd-9550-b9ba8f369e7e">
<li local-id=3D"cfb06f55-ee6a-4642-8e37-becd92743659">
<p local-id=3D"ab6a701b-5dd1-414f-b758-d26f7fc5201c"><strong>Two-step proce=
ss</strong>: Authorization first, financial settlement later</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"99ec3a3f-02ed-4b5e-80cd-7726ab95cb5f">
<p local-id=3D"f4bda97e-75e3-4e08-96a4-bedd050f0a04"><strong>0100/0110</str=
ong>: "Reserve" funds or check if transaction can proceed</p>
<ul local-id=3D"76cc6bfb-e689-46cc-bb3a-bd4c3d4002c8">
<li local-id=3D"ea047ff6-15ac-45c7-a3da-1664b2231664">
<p local-id=3D"05454cae-d548-46fc-99e0-c53ce4c162e8"><strong>No account deb=
it</strong> at this stage</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d5f5d2f2-8d01-4103-a0b9-d39919a6277f">
<p local-id=3D"d1b6ace8-6ac8-4b97-b203-ad5734236075">Places a hold on funds=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8cfa79c0-8609-4d3c-9027-e4a83f3aaf73">
<p local-id=3D"28790170-1d98-4ddd-9b05-07d2022d06ca">Gets approval code</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"b70965cc-933d-4f71-91bd-285389cb8b8e">
<p local-id=3D"6f8fe974-f6dd-4fc3-8781-161dea2f9951">Can be cancelled befor=
e financial message</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"fdec1b8f-e5ac-4cb8-b7ae-b729e4afb285">
<p local-id=3D"89bc0319-3cc8-4f61-b6f3-74c540b978fa"><strong>0120</strong>:=
 Optional notification that authorization was used</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ae936694-ff28-46e9-aad1-4fc06e77a46c">
<li local-id=3D"b1c2a7cd-b279-4859-b016-4f0a9edcff21">
<p local-id=3D"943e1551-7995-4c3e-9cd8-61b493e5ba65">Sent by acquirer/termi=
nal</p></li>
