<p local-id=3D"941bcb80-d3a9-4683-ab67-e716db7bb116">One-way message (no re=
sponse)</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"098d1057-e3e7-4432-bc96-c0ac22b08ed9">
<p local-id=3D"e3bc13e8-6e0b-499d-afa5-5d45050d6b2c"><strong>0220</strong>:=
 Actual fund transfer</p>
