<p local-id=3D"59ffd3ea-ad27-4410-9108-b98284ab9772">Can be sent in batch (=
hours later)</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"0700e238-7ab5-4ca9-8cee-ace598715100"><strong>Use Cases:</st=
rong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"18c11b86-6cb4-4f7e-9f7f-bfae0b297ebc">
<li local-id=3D"bdd8772c-3e81-4fc9-b8b2-88cb3b805e60">
<p local-id=3D"0018d1d1-f492-4064-9836-a326f89579c7"><strong>Hotel reservat=
ions</strong>: Auth on check-in ($500), actual charge on check-out ($450)</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"24562faf-0570-4c19-af21-efa5229f9612">
<p local-id=3D"5ccf0dd8-dd77-484f-9a15-a1e1093b18fd"><strong>Gas stations</=
strong>: Pre-auth $100, actual charge $45 after pumping</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d3ac55d3-6caa-423b-b5cd-65b822007dfd">
<p local-id=3D"5c9c5074-1c16-494f-8426-20ae88705779"><strong>Restaurants</s=
trong>: Auth for bill amount, final charge includes tip</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ae996660-465c-4d75-9877-f34e69b1a0a4">
<p local-id=3D"18afc085-8ee0-4130-894a-5f43ccbbaa44"><strong>E-commerce</st=
rong>: Auth when order placed, charge when shipped</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7d44bf6c-68ee-4ca8-9918-f66149211c8d">
<p local-id=3D"9b032a8e-b272-49d0-960c-9d313d29db3c"><strong>POS chip trans=
actions</strong>: Auth during chip read, financial after PIN verified</p></=
li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"964811f7-6e36-4153-a94d-caa69edf16ea"><strong>Advantages:</s=
trong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"9624dcee-abab-4526-be10-c14f655b58b3">
<li local-id=3D"c71ae487-c9ef-4a1a-8e66-f72d5ce43825">
<p local-id=3D"cf373767-6a94-48e8-a3e7-132e83dcb1cc">Allows transaction can=
cellation between auth and financial</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"64c7a6c1-1ad3-477b-8116-13127d2ab3fb">
<p local-id=3D"2a14b281-84c3-4e9b-baaf-ad89febf58e9">Customer can modify fi=
nal amount (tips, additional items)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"35a0bac8-8c5d-40e9-a3d0-7a483e5117a9">
<p local-id=3D"52d91469-42ab-4bcd-8928-a3fbc84431ec">Better fraud control -=
 funds reserved but not committed</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fb1701c5-439b-4fa8-a4e6-19002170113f">
<p local-id=3D"19bafa1a-719b-4d11-929f-c8a3432bfe21">Merchant can verify de=
livery before capturing funds</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a4afa70f-f6fd-4b77-b89b-fb1e0b6e1225">
<p local-id=3D"b9fffcec-eb7f-4b2a-ae6a-3ba040b738a3">Handles offline scenar=
ios (chip cards)</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"e569206c-c436-4936-b64f-f60cb038357f">
<h3 local-id=3D"723a4387-4ed0-460c-a546-d13e6f92d781" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-Single-StepFlow:0200=E2=86=920210">Single-Step Flow: 0200 =
=E2=86=92 0210</h3>
<p local-id=3D"f1362534-075a-43c0-81bb-4e9f05636f69"><strong>Characteristic=
s:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"dd2aea34-20c3-453b-888f-9a4fca388b2e">
<li local-id=3D"523b79c4-86aa-4eb8-ba8f-8048deb67b63">
<p local-id=3D"ade03c5b-39d5-4d00-bdec-4196b0bd2252"><strong>Single-step pr=
ocess</strong>: Authorization and financial combined</p></li>
