<p local-id=3D"fb19b85d-2463-4c8a-9c4a-2baf06c47de7"><strong>0220</strong>:=
 Only sent if transaction was offline</p>
<ul local-id=3D"aa1542f0-402b-4e64-8025-40105d35b443">
<li local-id=3D"50374c6f-1820-4310-aa2e-58c0f09a4e6c">
<p local-id=3D"c718be0d-c323-43c1-9776-2eb0f34ee0a9">Notifies issuer after =
reconnection</p></li>
