<p local-id=3D"574b231b-297d-4b26-8ec4-fb6797a4d59a">One-way advice message=
</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"35a4f0ee-dec6-4eea-8cb9-f9b97b5b99b3"><strong>Use Cases:</st=
rong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"22bd35f1-7397-4c6e-b84b-ccd153e34366">
<li local-id=3D"bf8ec4f3-f012-4ab3-be4a-2b65bd4e0c07">
<p local-id=3D"72de4f94-1cff-4843-99d5-3df7d6ef5d58"><strong>ATM withdrawal=
