<p local-id=3D"f9a1025a-2940-4a71-a286-ed7b76dd2836">MCDP</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"04b15afb-55a9-4725-9cdf-96db4e8156a1">
<p local-id=3D"c6711c5e-47e6-4eac-844d-d95842e657f0">BCFS</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"19813524-548f-4d6a-9471-2d6c5b06ee8d">
<p local-id=3D"13fb59e8-338a-4f45-afb0-4db980c4a85f">NORCROSS</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"9c77aa3f-a818-411b-af76-bb66cd419b8f" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-CreditSwitches">Credit Switches</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"e0693eca-c916-43dd-9b79-feb42b3a4207">
<li local-id=3D"3fde0e5e-ac46-4046-8b45-e3c9d484b68f">
<p local-id=3D"efa8b4e5-a2ac-40be-8c9c-eb4c9001f16d">Base2000</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ab5b8785-b33f-4bd0-b369-0547b9c0d1ed">
<p local-id=3D"e0ebc814-42f3-4e4b-9f1d-413914e1b803">P1C</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"12d76367-149d-4e55-ba39-1646f337898d" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-OtherSwitches">Other Switches</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"8e1f2cca-43c4-4adc-9e15-14c7e3597c32">
<li local-id=3D"2f2a92a9-5093-45d8-b751-739fdc8290f4">
<p local-id=3D"b6bbc41e-db3d-4055-80e2-af1251ac39b3">Discover (Implemented)=
</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"dbc98d11-dad8-467a-ad3b-1b156b0ec6d0">
<h2 local-id=3D"9b46e0ab-8bca-4f88-81c3-ec17bed438f9" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-SupportedTransactionTypes">Supported Transaction Types</h2=
>
<h3 local-id=3D"1cb1ebe0-52db-4947-b611-7cfd9d56c75a" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-DebitSwitches.1">Debit Switches</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"75d2cd16-8563-4d7d-82ce-7fa4c3af4c43">
<li local-id=3D"77e9fc74-5894-4b92-aaf9-3c47e3e38b47">
<p local-id=3D"43a3daa9-37db-4063-b900-3b66b72c0909">General authorization =
and advice flow transactions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8e62e9da-53e2-4ac4-af9f-32de7bcddbd0">
<p local-id=3D"1b5bdd7f-821d-4dd3-9196-744f73dbbd29"><strong>Supported MTIs=
</strong>: 0100, 0120, 0200, 0220, 0420</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"28a3a03f-479d-462f-95e4-853fc2d02b22">
<p local-id=3D"a99809b7-86e7-41a0-9550-6c5676f52993"><strong>Notes</strong>=
:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"0f0a8f43-24d9-422c-914b-849f05c5a662">
<li local-id=3D"c8326d1f-5e99-4123-9c0e-9f427891b963">
<p local-id=3D"30c23465-29b6-4dcd-b35d-6a6775d3857d">AFD (Account Funding D=
eposit) and Incrementals are <strong>not supported</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"64aa106f-753c-4ab3-8761-7ad3ff1d2c43">
<p local-id=3D"a7f105b0-b875-46d5-9599-4a54edff1a27">For any transaction, 0=
220 or 0420 is final</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d92dd06d-af52-4cb8-9527-a2b34d86b5b9">
<p local-id=3D"216f03d5-9bd4-4f6b-be46-ec030128c14e">We do not implement th=
e case where 0220 comes after 0420</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"33f3e1fe-4cfb-48dd-8259-111677830ae0">
<p local-id=3D"e354672a-711c-4c5c-9986-45221a3dd2d5">Instead, they are cons=
idered as two different transactions</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"bc12ab20-aa30-4caa-903d-ba2262ea76a6" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-CreditSwitches.1">Credit Switches</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"03d91d9a-c96e-4032-8ebc-e7848bb6a2f4">
<li local-id=3D"d14ec7ff-4be9-4567-b757-fa5771454100">
<p local-id=3D"f1348c5e-9e1c-41a5-9b69-88e3e0eb5d6c">General authorization =
and advice flow transactions</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1d6e4ac7-f4aa-4824-b652-c4e093990728">
<p local-id=3D"7cf3a3ad-9fc9-49e2-a40e-cbfdb1bc2e18"><strong>Supported MTIs=
</strong>: 0100, 0120, Event Broker (0140)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e3c93a7d-189d-4c49-b763-32ef094182fb">
<p local-id=3D"79fef9b3-3787-4500-9a65-195049f73ba3"><strong>Notes</strong>=
:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ec310d1b-24ec-4203-889c-7c6dff252171">
<li local-id=3D"adf487c2-f3ec-4939-8bc7-26edce51de9f">
<p local-id=3D"774421a1-fc69-498e-a907-85b76c1bbd12">0400 is <strong>not su=
pported</strong> but these messages appear in production</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"70bd16cb-50da-4266-b37f-c4cdf748911c">
<p local-id=3D"5ae7be75-0a60-4525-a505-d3394301c512">FIS has mentioned to i=
gnore 0400 messages</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f760c306-612a-425a-ab66-6061330416da">
<p local-id=3D"89ac1ef1-a943-4829-89d3-00a24e50b321">AFD and Incrementals <=
strong>are supported</strong>, MCC Supported 5542 only, In AFD Notification=
 are sent on second 0120 (completion) message</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a14984f0-1045-41b3-af83-4a36778ef4ed">
<p local-id=3D"e97c4e30-7438-40aa-ada8-e3686bfa6a29">For any transaction, 0=
140 or 0420 is final</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c34b54aa-8576-4bd0-8cd4-37a87e0a1230">
<p local-id=3D"1d7d755b-946f-48f4-be3e-ebdd670a2e8c">We do not implement th=
e case where 0140 comes after 0420</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a1de95c5-3f0c-47d9-ab85-851e9ba9336f">
<p local-id=3D"51975536-b478-402e-a67f-7d0e42b28cdc">Instead, they are cons=
idered as two different transactions</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"47b01ec0-e336-4104-8141-89da4a46f128">
<h2 local-id=3D"6f8b9553-c1e6-4baf-a874-d2fb9e6ac031" id=3D"AxonTransaction=
ProcessingKT(PM)-AdditionalNotes">Additional Notes</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"631ba579-c41e-4477-b2f9-8919a65d2da8">
<li local-id=3D"d6230b7f-6e3e-48d9-8f8b-db7ffd1d54fc">
<p local-id=3D"8313e37d-2bae-48dd-b310-3a5af4b22742">Always refer to the sp=
ecific switch documentation for detailed field mappings</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1c011fb5-464b-4516-9e3d-871a10cb4072">
<p local-id=3D"865358e3-ef99-412b-90c6-05bd1a7e9a94">Monitor response codes=
 to identify and troubleshoot issues</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e777b7da-17d8-45e9-99f5-b0aac5cfcd1b">
<p local-id=3D"c48e869a-fff8-42f3-8630-9abc62acab53">Ensure proper reversal=
 handling to maintain transaction integrity</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"65b8dddd-6c95-46b4-b32c-79b7a427110a">
<p local-id=3D"f247c2e1-867a-4654-9e74-7a3180070992">Keep track of STAN (Sy=
stems Trace Audit Number) for transaction tracking and reconciliation</p></=
li>
</ul>
